  "description": "cTab hardcodes its Android pages in cTab_fnc_updateInterface and raises no event when the page changes. This shows no cTab page in UKSF_ modes and raises uksf_ctab_modeChanged after every page change, so the uksf_ctab addon can show its app launcher and apps. cTab also registers its unconscious and inventory-changed close triggers with ace_common_fnc_addEventHandler and reads gear with ace_common_fnc_getAllGear, which current ACE no longer has; these move to the CBA ace_unconscious and player loadout events and read the unit's items directly. Each compiled .sqfc is removed because Arma loads it in place of the edited .sqf.",
